{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主喜欢的居家装修风格是？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，日主壬水生于申月，月柱庚申偏印极旺，时柱壬子比劫帮身，水势泛滥，身强无疑。月令庚申偏印透干，代表命主天生对非传统、神秘、古老文化有浓厚兴趣。地支辰土为日支，亦为华盖星，年支丑土亦为华盖，华盖重重，主智慧超群但性情孤高，喜好玄学、风水、古董等隐逸之物。综合判断，其居家风格必倾向于中式复古，重视风水布局，收藏古董摆设，以应偏印华盖之象。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 30385, "response_id": "c8330a6c-9496-4a1e-a005-61b74590c088", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 240, "completion_tokens": 1356, "total_tokens": 1596, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1211}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 112}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，日主壬水生于申月，地支申子辰三合水局，天干又透庚、壬、癸，金水极旺，为身强之命。命局喜火、土来制水调候，忌金、水。\n\n丙辰大运（命主设定为43–52岁），天干丙火为偏财，是用神透出，代表此运有求财创业之机。但丙坐辰为水库，财星力量不足，需待流年助火土才能成事。\n\n审视选项对应的年份：\n- **2018戊戌年**：流年天干戊土为七杀，地支戌土也为七杀，土极旺。七杀制身有力，能克制过旺的比劫，使命主能够承担事业。同时，流年地支戌与命主日支、大运地支辰形成辰戌冲，冲则动，代表事业、家庭的重大变动，有离乡出国之象。戊戌纳音平地木，土木相关，且土为房地产之象，与房地产业高度契合。\n- 其他年份如2017丁酉（印旺财被合）、2019己亥（比劫夺财官星虚浮），均非创业佳期。2015年不在所述大限内。\n\n因此，2018年出国创业并涉足房地产业最为应象。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 81301, "response_id": "5e0f296f-3fbd-4563-a38c-8752eeac0993", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 4405, "total_tokens": 4646, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4101}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，日主壬水生于申月，地支申子辰三合水局，时柱壬子，比劫强旺，为身极旺之命。用神为木火土，忌金水。大运乙卯（2018-2027年），伤官泄秀，本为好运。然2021年辛丑流年，天干辛金正印（忌神）透出，克制大运乙木伤官用神，形成“印星夺食”之局，财源被断；地支丑土为官星，看似喜神，但与命局年支丑伏吟，且与日支辰破、时支子合水，湿土助水势，官星制水乏力。财源（乙木）受克，资金周转不灵，生意难以为继，正应“生意下跌，资金不够周转，倒闭”之象。\n\n大运乙木伤官为财源，流年辛金为印，印克伤官，代表因外部政策、长辈或自身决策失误导致事业受阻。以子丑合、丑辰破，亦主内部不和及资金破损。故A选项最为契合。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 126371, "response_id": "b32b9e85-ac65-4370-80e8-c84caa05328f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 5886, "total_tokens": 6127, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5624}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n**1. 八字排盘与格局分析**  \n命主八字：癸丑 庚申 壬辰 壬子  \n日主壬水生于申月得长生，地支申子辰三合水局，天干透出壬癸，水势泛滥，为身旺至极的命局（类似润下格，但年支丑土有破格之嫌）。水旺无制，喜木泄、火暖、土挡，原局木火土皆弱，先天健康隐患在于水旺火弱（心血管、肾脏）、土虚（脾胃）、水多木漂（肝胆、筋骨）。\n\n**2. 大运与流年交互**  \n命主2024年51岁，正行乙卯大运（45-54岁），流年甲辰。  \n- 乙卯为伤官大运，木旺泄水本为吉，但卯木与原局时支子水构成**子卯相刑**，刑伤筋骨。  \n- 流年甲辰，甲木食神透出，坐辰土七杀。甲辰与日柱壬辰**伏吟**，且引动原局申子辰三合水局，水势滔天，水多木漂，食神无力制杀，反为水困。  \n- 最关键的是，大运卯木与流年辰土构成**卯辰相穿害**，此为无礼之刑穿，主突发性伤害、横祸。卯为震卦，象征车辆、足部；辰为水库，也为湿土肉象。卯辰穿害，木克土，足部或四肢受伤，结合车祸信息明显。\n\n**3. 健康应期推断**  \n- 选项A（单纯肥胖）：水旺之人体胖，但伏吟加穿害，不可能是“无碍”，必有不顺。  \n- 选项B（脊椎侧弯）：久坐导致的慢性病，卯辰穿更主急性外伤，且脊椎侧弯常对应木土交战，但这里穿害力量更凶。  \n- 选项C（鼻癌）：金主肺鼻，原局庚申金被旺水耗泄（水多金沉），大运木旺反克金，的确有呼吸系统风险，但缺乏火毒信息，且卯辰穿、子卯刑指向金木相搏的骨折外伤。  \n- 选项D（左脚骨折）：大运卯（足）与流年辰相穿，子卯刑也应在足；甲木食神坐辰，木为四肢，辰为骨肉，伏吟加穿害，恰逢水旺泛滥，极易发生因水湿滑跌或车辆（卯为车）导致的足部骨折。\n\n### 最终答案\nD", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R1_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 51129, "response_id": "a91d3919-0eba-4b79-880f-7d843a84efc9", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 238, "completion_tokens": 2483, "total_tokens": 2721, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion